@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade DevOps - Observabilidad, logging y senales de ejecucion

component "Dependencia Spring Boot Actuator" as Actuator EZ_BACKEND
component "Dependencia de observabilidad Spring Modulith" as ModulithObs EZ_BACKEND
component "Logs de acceso Tomcat\nserver.tomcat.accesslog.*" as AccessLogs EZ_BACKEND
component "CommonsRequestLoggingFilter\nincluye query + payload" as RequestLogging EZ_BACKEND
component "Logs de aplicacion\nloggers SLF4J" as AppLogs EZ_BACKEND
component "Fallos en canales de notificacion\nlog.warn" as NotificationLogs EZ_BACKEND
component "Errores de mercado externo\nExternalApiException" as MarketErrors EZ_BACKEND

folder "logs/\naccess*.log" as LogsFolder EZ_DB

AccessLogs --> LogsFolder
RequestLogging --> AppLogs
NotificationLogs --> AppLogs
MarketErrors --> AppLogs
Actuator ..> AppLogs : dependencia presente
ModulithObs ..> AppLogs : dependencia presente

note right
No hay registro Prometheus, dashboard Grafana,
OpenTelemetry tracing, centralized log shipper
ni configuracion de alertas.
end note

note bottom
Evidencia: application.properties, HttpObservabilityConfig.java, pom.xml,
NotificationService.java y AlphaVantageAPI.java.
end note

@enduml
